# Upstream refactoring.nvim's own test fixtures.
#
# These files are the ground truth for the refactoring suite: they are
# upstream's inputs and upstream's expected outputs, copied byte for byte
# from refactoring.nvim/tests/files. Reformatting them would break the
# comparison against upstream's documented behaviour, so they are excluded
# from StyLua.
#
# The rest of tests/ is the harness itself and is formatted normally.
tests/fixtures/
